sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Agent Pay failure: checkout total exceeds the registered intent
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: Agent Pay failure: checkout total exceeds the registered intent. 3 participants: Agent platform, Merchant, and Mastercard network. 3 steps, 2 crossing a trust boundary, 2 failure branches. Based on mastercard-agent-pay Agent Pay developer guides (unversioned, read 2026-10-11) (2026-10-11). Step 1: Agent platform to Merchant: Checkout with intentId. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: Merchant to Merchant: Compare totals. If Total greater than orderTotalAmount: Reject. If srcDpaId differs: Reject. Step 3: Merchant to Agent platform: Reject checkout. This step crosses a trust boundary.
  autonumber
  participant p_agent as Agent platform
  participant p_merchant as Merchant
  participant p_network as Mastercard network
  p_agent->>p_merchant: Checkout with intentId
  Note over p_agent,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_merchant->>p_merchant: Compare totals
  else Total greater than orderTotalAmount
    Note over p_merchant: Reject
  else srcDpaId differs
    Note over p_merchant: Reject
  end
  p_merchant->>p_agent: Reject checkout
  Note over p_merchant,p_agent: Crosses a trust boundary
